OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-damaged seafront gets huge
OL,4,Aboulder delivery
OL,5,
OL,6,FTonnes of large boulders have been
OL,7,Fdelivered by boat to help reinforce a
OL,8,Fstorm-battered seafront.
OL,10,FDefences at Torcross in Devon were
OL,11,Fbadly damaged by storms in January,
OL,12,Fleading to part of the A379 coastal
OL,13,Froad between Torcross and Slapton being
OL,14,Fwashed away.
OL,16,FThe Environment Agency (EA) is now
OL,17,Fcarrying out a #19.8m scheme to better
OL,18,Fprotect the area, with nearly 60,000
OL,19,Ftonnes of rock to begin arriving by sea
OL,20,Fand 30,000 tonnes of smaller material
OL,21,Fto be transported by road.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
