OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-damaged seafront gets huge
OL,4,Aboulder delivery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large boat was seen delivering a
OL,7,Fshipment of the boulders onto the sand
OL,8,Fat Torcross earlier. The EA said the
OL,9,Fbeach would be closed to the public
OL,10,Fwhile the work was carried out.
